    "message": "Static Data Covenant: harvest metropolis live-presence via CI, not the browser\n\npages/metropolis/index.html called api.github.com/repos/<slug>/events\ndirectly from the visitor's browser to compute per-neighborhood live\npresence. Per RAR CONSTITUTION.md Article XXIV, moved that to a CI\nharvester (scripts/harvest-metropolis-activity.py) that writes a trimmed,\ncommitted snapshot at pages/metropolis/activity-snapshot.json; the page\nnow reads that snapshot and keeps the same actor-counting logic. Added a\nscheduled workflow to keep it refreshed, and generated the initial\nsnapshot from a real API call.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
